I think that the battlemage could be ok if you tweaked the magic system 
for it.  The idea would be to allow the battlemage to cast attack spells 
easily, but impose severe penalties for all of the other schools so that 
the player couldn't really cast anything beyond level 1 or 2 even with 
no armor and a robe and a helm of brilliance.

While the player could get the finger for the late game they wouldn't 
have access to all of the other goodies, like dig, cancellation, haste, 
remove curse, etc.

This would basically be a wizard with an easier early game but a more 
difficult mid and late game.  This would let newer players get to have 
some fun with magic without the steep learning curve of a wizard.

